@host = http://localhost:5056

### Get all trips
GET {{host}}/api/saga/v1/trips
Accept: application/json

###

### Get a trip by ID (replace {id} with an actual GUID)
GET {{host}}/api/saga/v1/trips/{id}
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a new trip
POST {{host}}/api/saga/v1/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sample Trip",
  "startDate": "2025-11-01T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2025-11-10T00:00:00Z",
  "destination": "Paris"
}

###